Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,93)}Dinosaur Hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs29\)\pos(280,563)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? A Dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.43,0:00:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.98,0:00:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I did saw it after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That was interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:01:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, there was a super giant dinosaur here just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.45,0:01:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you saw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm went dinosaur hunting with Sewashi-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinosaur hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an super-interesting sports that's trending now in the 22nd century.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.38,0:01:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! So, that dinosaur was...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.55,0:01:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sewashi-kun was taking it to 22nd century....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,from 10,000,000,000 years ago using time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He decided to give it a rest here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So that Sewashi-{\i1}kun{\i0} can have a dinosaur as a pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm going to join you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that for? You're so mean, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.61,0:01:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a very dangerous sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.07,0:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to have strong body and be consistent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,also the guts to be not scared of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.79,0:01:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, it's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, do you have those {\i1}qualities{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.96,0:01:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! There's a rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,~Kyaa! I'm afraid of rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:01:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I HATE rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.38,0:02:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually I lied!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.22,0:02:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You are brave, huh?  You sure don't say....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong body and youth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, I will take you with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna join us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have to be prepared before you hunt dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get butter and jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.33,0:02:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too much, I told you to bring only butter and jelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not, these are for our lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we're ready now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dash off to hunt Dinosaurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:03:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the world, 10,000,000,000 years ago, it's so cool! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.91,0:03:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But Doraemon, tell me! How are we going to hunt Dinosaurs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on me, I have my secret weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Cell Atrophy Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how big some biological being is, it will shrink only in a seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, I got the wrong one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.81,0:03:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this messy because you put unnecessary stuff in my pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.69,0:03:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you how powerful this machine is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How cool! It shrunk and became so small!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, it's hard to control, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to use it randomly, when there's no dinosaur around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, let me go lure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel very scared, I think we'd better go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, here comes the big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.24,0:04:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, shoot him, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run, Nobita! You must shoot, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, stop, it's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,See, it's like an ant now, you can't make it bigger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, dino.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now butter and jam...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:04:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna eat now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, you see....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean! You have gone too far, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that you'd use me as a bait to lure the dinosaur...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...with butter and jelly on my face and head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am experienced, so I am not nervous at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,See how calm I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Doraemon? Shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared, unlike you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.10,0:05:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, so hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? I got the wrong one...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this, not this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I have got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.12,0:05:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's terrible, we're so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's run now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,B-but my glasses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.93,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(674,371)\frz262.2}Dinosaur fossil discovered with eyeglasses
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.93,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(458,279)\frz255.9}from 10,000,000,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big news even in the parliament right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Big news!
